Full uint boundary pool to draw from: 0, 1, 255 (0xff), 256 (0x100), 65535 (0xffff), 2^64-1, 2^128-1, 2^255 (0x8000…), 2^256-1 (0xffff…ff / uint256 max). Do NOT chase rounding/precision or division bugs — those are out of scope. DO NOT default to the names in the example below — they are placeholders.

